  "text": "## Step 3: Final Balance Calculation  \n### Balance Calculation Process  \n**Step 1: Collect All Transactions**\n- Pull all transactions since last statement\n- Include pending transactions (standing orders, direct debits due)\n- Verify no unprocessed deposits/withdrawals  \n**Step 2: Calculate Final Balance**\n- Ledger balance (posted transactions)\n- Add any pending interest (if accrual period not yet completed)\n- Subtract any pending fees (overdraft, if applicable)\n- Verify balance matches account record in AMS  \n**Step 3: Document Balance**\n- Print final statement\n- Include calculation date\n- List all pending transactions\n- Final balance clearly stated  \n**Step 4: Approval**\n- Operations manager verifies calculation\n- Sign-off on final statement\n- File in account closure record",
